                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240951046479.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240951046479.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240951056932.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240951056932.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">海子</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">说</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">活在这珍贵的人间，太阳强烈，水波温柔</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">生活说到底是关于当下的体验</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">无论何时</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">晴空软云</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">长风沛雨</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，都是我们所需要的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一次</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五月</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">远行</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">亦恰逢其时</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">这个故事有炽热的温度，有热闹的开始</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">山下的小教场上</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我们举行破冰仪式，然而所谓</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">破冰</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">之</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">冰</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">似乎从未真正存在过</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教官</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同学</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">们</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">想象着同一段尚未开启的旅程，便有了并肩携行的熟悉与亲密</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一声声关于集体的宣告响彻天际，令人</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">相信</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">青春便是此刻放声一喊</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">嗓音舒展，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">筋节</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">也打开，从身体到精神</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">都化成一阵干净舒爽的风，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">向</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">青山中去</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240951389626.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240951389626.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240951392138.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240951392138.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240951402356.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240951402356.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span>
</p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">初</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">时</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">天色不</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">甚</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">明朗</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">但山色却愈显妩媚</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">清新的空气和高饱和度的浓</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绿，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">都被深深呼吸</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">自然以无数具体的形象扑面而来</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">让我们一见倾心，又一见如故</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">往日各色的烦忧被</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">淘洗</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一尽</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">此刻我们谈论旅程，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">却不染风尘。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">向密密的山林中去</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">课本中</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">清流急湍，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">映带左右</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">之语，生动地映照了现实</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">有微雨丝缕，穿过</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">枝桠</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">湿润脸庞，也激活山的血脉</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">潦水</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">晶莹</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">帘挂阶</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下，用手拨动路边的水流，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">清清泠泠</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">从指尖入心</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">石道蜿蜒，我们</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">拾级</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">而上，在欣喜与疲惫间起落升降，最终</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">接受</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">感受的复杂，生活的复杂。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240952090263.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240952090263.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240952091282.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240952091282.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span>
</p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我们温习所有会唱的歌，玩各种简单却足以装载</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一路</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">欢笑的游戏</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中途休整时间</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">也演绎出</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">许多</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">精彩段落</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">汪曾祺说</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四方食事不过一碗人间烟火</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">而有彼此陪伴，便是赶赴人间最盛的宴席。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下山</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">时</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">阳光方才烹煮成熟，万物呈现最迷人的色彩</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">天空湛蓝，云朵饱满，山路拐弯处常有</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深谷</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">似海。远处一座</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">宁静</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的水库，足令</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">灵魂</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">徜徉其间，满山深浅色，照在绿波中。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">身体机能逼近</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">极限</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，对当下的自己与身边的环境也留下了极其鲜明的印象</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">话语无需出口，节奏相同的步伐已是最具说服力的默契</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">疲惫</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">徐徐行</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">之</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，但从不</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">停下脚步</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，我们共同遵守</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">着</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">这</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一并未被强调</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的纪律</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">面对所有道足且长的历练，我们都将保持如</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">斯</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">信念。</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">远足归来</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">身体像一</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">片</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下过雨的云，释放了所有</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">精力，又内在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">安定，思绪轻盈</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">远足的劳累也像一阵雨一</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">样</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">流</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">失</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了，剩下的回忆</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">满是</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">温和的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">笑影。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.33in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高二晚读资料里</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">有木心先生写给</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月的诗</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.33in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">你这样吹过</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">清凉，柔和</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">再吹过来的</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我知道不是你了</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">盛夏将至，年轻的生命蓬勃生长。我们将不再是过去的我们，但无需抱憾，因为清凉柔和依旧，而青春的大火</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">将灿烂未来的岁月。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
